  "scope": "Prospective first evaluation on four real UAE drives. The source IDs were excluded from 470 prior project evaluation, screened and metadata-only drives before they were viewed. Driver-view photos were selected by one independent AI reviewer, with no project predictions or candidate flags. Frozen descriptions and original-pixel regions preceded Task 1 inference, surface maps and the separately released local 8B observations. This measures pictured passenger locations.",
  "evaluation": "One real Edge process on the frozen local 102-scene application, using 13 separate sessions. Each first response, source JPEG digest and screenshot was preserved before inspecting source candidate supply. The renderer blocked non-local connections. Local source registrations and the session journal were verified for every decision. The 15-second first-turn deadline and 45-second observation limit were fixed in advance. There were no repeat attempts.",
